{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國企業花在開源大模型上的錢，正在持續流向中國公司。近日，矽谷風投機構門羅風投（Menlo Ventures）發佈《2026年企業AI現狀報告》。基於對近400名美國企業AI業務負責人的調研，報告估算，美國企業用於開源大模型的支出中，89%流向了中國模型，受訪者負責的AI支出合計超過40億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585820.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:02:16.768505+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:39:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_hash":"dc32c38fc59fd2998bfaa75f17ad6c6d56db12b86b4eae6cb9b00e308e877db0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}